cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Pacioli in academic work, please cite the project itself
  rather than individual contributors. This CITATION.cff follows the
  CFF standard (https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
title: Pacioli
abstract: >-
  A read-only compliance scanner for Azure Terraform code. Built on
  Checkov, but aggregates per-environment SARIF into a single coverage
  matrix mapped to a chosen framework (PCI DSS v4.0.1, SOC 2, CIS
  Azure, NIST 800-53, ISO 27001). Emits a self-contained HTML report
  with full per-requirement drill-down, in-line azurerm 4.x remediation
  HCL, severity breakdowns, and a CI gate.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
# repository-code: filled in at first public release; see SUPPORT.md
repository-code: https://github.com/JosiahSiegel/pacioli
keywords:
